SCOPE OF THE ABOVE

The MIT licence above covers only what the 1.6 port added:

  - the repointed dependency and the rest of About.xml
  - the six corrections to the patches: the single declaration of
    VBY_TripleHayBed and the removal that makes it one, the 3-person leather
    bed joining the leather bed removal, the conditional around the hay crib
    block, the dead Table_LightEndTable facility reference, the move from
    PatchOperationFindMod to MayRequireAnyOf, and ArtableBedBase as the
    3-person bed's parent
  - the reorganisation: Defs/triplebeds.xml, and the 3-person bed leaving the
    shared xpaths in Patches/haybeds.xml
  - the French translation
  - the packaging and the documentation

IT DOES NOT COVER THE ORIGINAL MOD. The nine defs, their stats, their costs,
their recipes and their graphics are cyanobot's work, reused here:

  https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3449202390

The bed and blanket textures are Phaneron's, from Primitive Workbenches
Retexture, used by cyanobot with permission - permission given to cyanobot,
which says nothing about this port:

  https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3038407835

Neither of them ever declared a licence, so none is granted here and none can
be. Their work is redistributed under the usual practice for abandoned mods -
explicit credit, a link to the original, and removal on request.
About/Preview.png is cyanobot's as it stands.

If cyanobot or Phaneron asks for this to be taken down, it comes down.
Immediately, and without discussion.

ATTRIBUTION.md records what was taken and what was changed.
